  "remarks": "Former so-called “Minister of Foreign Affairs” of the so-called “Donetsk People’s Republic (DNR)”, current member of the Federation Council Committee on International Affairs and a Senator of the DNR. She is also Coordinator of the “United Russia Women’s Movement” project, and Deputy Secretary of the regional branch of United Russia in the DNR for propaganda. In taking on and acting in this capacity, she has actively undermined the territorial integrity, sovereignty and independence of Ukraine.",
